WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.440
Raj: There's hidden coupling through the global client. Testing formatting currently requires a network connection.
全局客户端造成隐藏耦合，测格式化目前还需要联网。

2
00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:14.304
Lukas: That's a concrete reason to separate boundaries. Which changes have the highest recurring cost?
这是拆边界的具体理由，哪些修改反复成本最高？

3
00:00:14.304 --> 00:00:21.935
Anika: Filtering changes touch fetching and rendering together. Just to confirm, separating those helps, right?
筛选修改会同时碰取数和渲染，确认一下，拆开会有帮助，对吧？

4
00:00:21.935 --> 00:00:29.159
Priya: Okay, our bandwidth covers two engineers this sprint. Maybe three days go to test discovery.
好，本迭代只有两名工程师投入，测试梳理可能花三天。

5
00:00:29.159 --> 00:00:38.159
Hannah: A characterization test will expose those dependencies. Use injected test clients instead of real calls.
现有行为测试能暴露这些依赖，用注入测试客户端，不发真实请求。

6
00:00:38.159 --> 00:00:45.479
Raj: One action item is removing import-time requests. Importing the module shouldn't start a job.
一项任务是移除导入时请求，导入模块不应启动作业。

7
00:00:45.479 --> 00:00:54.167
Lukas: Good, but keep credential handling unchanged externally. Internal separation doesn't authorize a security redesign.
好，但外部凭据处理保持不变，内部拆分不代表授权安全重设计。

8
00:00:54.167 --> 00:01:01.486
Priya: Let's take it offline for framework comparisons. First agree on the behavior we must preserve.
框架对比会后聊，先同意必须保留的行为。

9
00:01:01.486 --> 00:01:10.102
Hannah: We'll measure isolated test runtime as evidence. Faster tests are useful, not the sole goal.
记录隔离测试耗时，测试更快有用但不是唯一目标。

10
00:01:10.102 --> 00:01:18.190
Anika: Agreed, unchanged reports matter more to consumers. I'll collect the command-line invocation examples today.
同意，使用方更重视报表不变，今天收集命令行调用样例。

